---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PhotoJournal from "../components/PhotoJournal.astro";
import FishingCat from "../components/FishingCat.astro";
import { featuredPhotos, fishingPhoto } from "../lib/photos";
import { base } from "../lib/site";
---
<Layout
  title="赵郎溪"
  description="Zhao Langxi · 赵郎溪. A personal visual journal: ocean light, campus days, and the habit of looking twice."
  canonical="https://zhao-langxi.github.io/zhao-langxi/"
  current="home"
  bodyClass="home"
  ogTitle="赵郎溪 · Zhao Langxi"
  ogDescription="A personal journal of photographs and days. Jade Zhao · 赵郎溪 · @zhao.langxi."
>
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <header class="hero">
      <img
        class="hero-photo"
        src={`${base}${fishingPhoto.src}`}
        alt={fishingPhoto.alt}
        width={fishingPhoto.width}
        height={fishingPhoto.height}
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p>Zhào Lángxī · @zhao.langxi</p>
        <h1 lang="zh-Hans">赵郎溪</h1>
        <p class="home-tagline">
          How I see the world. Ocean light, a fishing line, and the days in between.
        </p>
        <p>
          Jade Zhao. A visual journal from Indiana University, home weekends, and a spring in Spain.
          Not a studio, and not a résumé.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <article>
      <section class="feature-block" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
        <div class="feature-head">
          <h2 id="journal-heading">From the journal</h2>
          <p>
            Six frames I actually took. The rest of the days live in one journal, not empty rooms.
          </p>
        </div>
        <PhotoJournal photos={featuredPhotos} variant="board" idPrefix="home" eagerCount={2} />
        <p class="feature-more">
          <a href={`${base}days.html`}>All fourteen days</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="story" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
        <h2 id="story-heading">How I got to the river</h2>
        <p>
          On Instagram the bio is still the true one: <em>xiao mao diao yu</em> ... little cat fishing ...
          <em>pov reformed ipad kid</em>. The fishing photo is not a brand exercise. It is me, on a boat,
          before anyone asked for a résumé line.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am Jade Zhao. Chinese American. I grew up in a family Chinese restaurant in central Indiana
          (Greenfield, Indiana). IU felt mutual. Spain was a semester of learning a city that was never
          designed around me.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="name" aria-labelledby="name-heading">
        <h2 id="name-heading">The name · <span lang="zh-Hans">我的名字</span></h2>
        <p>
          The characters on this door are <strong lang="zh-Hans">赵郎溪</strong>.
          In pinyin that is <strong>Zhào Lángxī</strong> ... ordinary dictionary readings, not a
          family lecture I am inventing here.
        </p>
        <ul class="name-list">
          <li><span lang="zh-Hans">赵</span> · Zhào · the family surname.</li>
          <li><span lang="zh-Hans">郎溪</span> · Lángxī · the given name as written on this site.</li>
          <li>Jade Zhao is the English name I use. <span lang="zh-Hans">赵郎溪</span> is the name I wanted to grow into.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="placeholder-note">
          Why those two given-name characters were chosen, and any family story behind them, is
          still waiting for me to write it in my own words. I am not filling that gap with a pretty
          guess.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="places" aria-labelledby="places-heading">
        <h2 id="places-heading">Places the days happened</h2>
        <ol class="place-index">
          <li>
            <a href={`${base}iu.html`}>
              <span class="essay-kicker">Campus · Bloomington</span>
              <span class="essay-title">IU</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`${base}indiana.html`}>
              <span class="essay-kicker">College town · home weekends</span>
              <span class="essay-title">Indiana</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`${base}spain.html`}>
              <span class="essay-kicker">Study abroad · Spring 2026</span>
              <span class="essay-title">Spain</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="cat-mark" aria-labelledby="cat-heading">
        <FishingCat size={64} title="A little cat by the water" markId="home" />
        <div>
          <h2 id="cat-heading"><span lang="zh-Hans">小猫钓鱼</span></h2>
          <p>
            The picture-book lesson I keep: curiosity, patience, watching the water.
            <a href={`${base}xiao-mao-diao-yu.html`}>Read the story</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="quiet-links">
        Days also live on
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/zhao.langxi" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram @zhao.langxi</a>.
        Older writing is
        <a href={`${base}archive.html`}>on hiatus in the archive</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
